{"id":"2005f7c77a4cbc08","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-many-one-reduction.md","title":"多一归约","display":"df-many-one-reduction — 多一归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-many-one-reduction","aliases":["29-df-many-one-reduction"],"display":"df-many-one-reduction — 多一归约","depends_on":["[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","[[29-df-q-c]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-query]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Definition2.11, pp.28–29, scans43–44"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-many-one-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-many-one-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one-reduction — 多一归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b24f25338d17d661\" href=\"?note=b24f25338d17d661\" title=\"29-df-q-c\">29-df-q-c</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17c1d364fcf4fba1\" href=\"?note=17c1d364fcf4fba1\" title=\"29-df-query\">29-df-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition2.11, pp.28–29, scans43–44"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为有序输入布尔查询。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是多项式大小有界、保持有序结构同构的查询；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是二进制判定语言类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b24f25338d17d661\" href=\"?note=b24f25338d17d661\" title=\"29-df-q-c\">29-df-q-c</a> 的逐位计算接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\)</span> 不是本定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 参数实例；结构FO归约使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\{I\\in Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(U\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(U)\\in\\mathcal B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\{I\\in Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(U\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(U)\\in\\mathcal B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\leq_C\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A\\leq_C\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition2.11，印刷页28–29、扫描页43–44；这里按本库已有OrdSTRUC有序对表示显式写出计算查询接口，避免调用不存在的ComplexityClass集合以及无参数Q(C)。一阶多一归约另有定义，不能因FO名字出现就把≤FO标成来自本条。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-q-c","status":"resolved","id":"b24f25338d17d661","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-q-c]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-query","status":"resolved","id":"17c1d364fcf4fba1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-q-c","status":"resolved","id":"b24f25338d17d661","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 是多项式大小有界、保持有序结构同构的查询；$C$ 是二进制判定语言类。$Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-q-c]] 的逐位计算接口。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}$ 不是本定义的 $C$ 参数实例；结构FO归约使用 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\{I\\in Q(C)[\\sigma,\\tau]\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;(U\\in\\mathcal A\\leftrightarrow I(U)\\in\\mathcal B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\leq_C\\mathcal B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\operatorname{-}\\mathrm{ManyOneReduction}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1699,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-many-one-reduction]]、[[29-df-completeness]] — 多一归约与完全性"},{"id":"3c678e2ee71047b3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"240580939d1fd13a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e33d8f1b508c3705","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2a4804023516b8f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-many-one-reduction]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-many-one-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["4f651c8d1bdc9a58","65b448b4269ca18e","b24f25338d17d661","4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae","17c1d364fcf4fba1","2017fdd1c0072445"]}